 "name": "Track filter: a 12 dB low-pass filter per track with envelope",
 "description": [
  "Hold RETRIG + press GATE = filter mode on, tap RETRIG = off. In the mode: PITCH = cutoff, DECAY = envelope decay,",
  "COLOR = resonance, SHAPE = envelope depth (bipolar); the four knob LEDs light up. Cutoff 127 = filter off.",
  "Four real parameters on every machine: p-lockable, LFO and velocity destinations, CC 74 / 71, saved with the sound."
